# Keqing Chevreuse Xiangling Bennett. ~20s Rot. Electro Keqing Overload. A funneled Chevreuse and Xiangling burst every rotation in Bennett Q, then Keqing Spams N1C during and out of Bennett burst. C6 Bennett is DPS Neutral; Pyro & Electro Goblet see similar performance.

# Team- Options listsed by DPS
keqing char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
keqing add weapon="finale" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#keqing add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#keqing add weapon="lionsroar" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
#keqing add weapon="umbrella" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
